   <summary><h3>Apply in progress</h3></summary>

| Pull Request | Operation | State | Created At |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
@#work_manifests-@
| @?is_pr-@ #@id@ @-/is_pr@@!is_pr-@ @id@ @-/is_pr@ | @run_type@ | @state@ | @created_at@ UTC |
@/work_manifests-@

If this appears to be stuck, unlock it by commenting in any pull request:

```
stategraph unlock@-#work_manifests@ @id@@/work_manifests@
```

**Be careful when unlocking.**  Make sure that these runs are actually stuck by verifying if there are any running GitLab CI workflows.

If this persists, verify the GitLab CI workflow matches the [documentation](https://terrateam.io/docs/getting-started).

